    "faq": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kitty Hawk Kites Offer Free Shipping?",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping is available on orders over $99 and will apply automatically in your cart.</p><p></p><p>Some select items are excluded from free shipping due to size and/or weight, like Bogg Bags, Neso Tents, and some accessories.</p><p>See the entire Free Shipping Policy <a href=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/free-shipping-offer\" title=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/free-shipping-offer\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why is My Discount Code Not Working?",
            "content": "<p>All of our discount codes are automated and will not work unless all requirements have been met. Typical discount requirements include:</p><ul><li>Minimum order cost</li><li>Only specific products included in discount</li><li>Discount only applies to a customer's first order</li></ul><p>Unless specified, our discounts do not combine. Our check out automatically uses the best discount when multiple are attempted.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_dBwgF8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kitty Hawk Kites Price Match?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Kitty Hawk Kites does offer price matching. Please see our entire Price Match Policy <a href=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/price-match-guarantee\" title=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/price-match-guarantee\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_gyJVNG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are In-Store and Online Inventories the Same?",
            "content": "<p>No, there are differences in inventory types, quantiies, and prices between online and in-store. For more information please see our Inventory/Pricing Policy <a href=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/inventory-pricing-policy\" title=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/inventory-pricing-policy\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
