    "section_faq_PYbDQX": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Qpp9MD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kitty Hawk Kites Offer Kite Repairs?",
            "content": "<p>Kitty Hawk Kites offers in-store kite repair at many of our <a href=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/find-a-store/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/find-a-store/\">kite store locations</a></p><p>Please reach out to orders@kittyhawk.com with any specific repair questions and we will do our best to find a solution.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_hk8d4i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kitty Hawk Kites Sell Replacement Parts?",
            "content": "<p>If there is a specific part you need, we recommend reaching out to the manufacturers directly.</p><p>Premier Kites: customercare@premierkites.com and include the item number, item name and description of what you need.</p><p>X-Kites & WindNSun Kites: Fill out the form found <a href=\"https://support.brainstormproducts.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056508411-How-can-I-get-replacement-parts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://support.brainstormproducts.com/hc/en-us/articles/360056508411-How-can-I-get-replacement-parts\">here</a>.</p><p>Prism Kites: Find replacement parts <a href=\"https://prismkites.com/collections/replacement-parts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://prismkites.com/collections/replacement-parts\">here</a>.</p><p>For other manufacturers please reach out to orders@kittyhawk.com for more information.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
