    "section_faq_FzHi3m": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_98jdx9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is Kitty Hawk Kites?",
            "content": "<p>Kitty Hawk Kites, Inc. was founded in 1974 by John Harris, a pioneer in hang gliding, to provide instruction, products, and service to the burgeoning new sport. In the late 1980s, Kitty Hawk Kites expanded into what is now it's two businesses; providing recreational adventures such as Hang Gliding, Kayaking, Kiteboarding, Jet Skiing, Parasailing and much, much more; selling kites (such as stunt kites, power kites and single line kites), toys, wind art, Life is Good, OBX apparel and gifts from it's retail stores and on our online store.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_JeGtVm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I find a Kitty Hawk Kites Store Near Me?",
            "content": "<p>You can see all of our current retail locations <a href=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/find-a-store/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/find-a-store/\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_zPngpJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kitty Hawk Kites Do Charitable Donations?",
            "content": "<p>For any donation requests please fill out our Donation Request Form, which can be found <a href=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/donation-request/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.kittyhawk.com/donation-request/\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_8PViMX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Kitty Hawk Kite's Privacy Policy",
            "content": "<p>Our complete privacy policy can be found <a href=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://store.kittyhawk.com/pages/privacy-policy\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
